msgid ""
"The `Pixracer <https://store.mrobotics.io/mRo-PixRacer-R14-Official-p/auav-"
"pxrcr-r14-mr.htm>`__ is the first autopilot of the FMUv4 Pixhawk generation."
" It comes with a small Wifi extension board."
msgstr ""
"`Pixracer <https://store.mrobotics.io/mRo-PixRacer-R14-Official-p/auav-"
"pxrcr-r14-mr.htm>`__ 是 FMUv4 Pixhawk 系列的第一款飞控。它附带一块小型 Wifi 扩展板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixracer-overview.rst:23
#: a1004c46d2a94773982db04f84fd1d46
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixracer-overview.rst:25
#: 0b9862fe27804e609478f8760998e7a5
msgid ""
"The `Pixracer <https://store.mrobotics.io/mRo-PixRacer-R14-Official-p/auav-"
"pxrcr-r14-mr.htm>`__ is the common name for the FMUv4 generation of Pixhawk "
"autopilots. It has been designed primarily for the demanding requirements of"
" small multicopters, but of course can be used on planes and other vehicles "
"which require no more than 6 pwm outputs for controlling escs and motors. "
"Pixracer is available from the `mRobotics <https://store.mrobotics.io/mRo-"
"PixRacer-R14-Official-p/auav-pxrcr-r14-mr.htm>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Pixracer <https://store.mrobotics.io/mRo-PixRacer-R14-Official-p/auav-"
"pxrcr-r14-mr.htm>`__ 是 FMUv4 系列 Pixhawk "
"飞控的通用名称。它主要为小型多旋翼的严苛需求而设计，当然也可用于只需不超过 6 路 PWM 输出来控制 ESC "
"和电机的飞机和其他飞行器。Pixracer 可从 `mRobotics <https://store.mrobotics.io/mRo-"
"PixRacer-R14-Official-p/auav-pxrcr-r14-mr.htm>`__ 获得"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixracer-overview.rst:33
#: 445a120856f54e31bf1ffee7ecd8e2a4
msgid ""
"At time of writing the autopilot is still being evolved/improved. The final "
"version may very slightly from the information provided here."
msgstr "撰写本文时，该飞控仍在持续发展/改进中。最终版本可能与此处提供的信息略有不同。"

